Z||000002||Shaun41178||06-05-2001||06:18 PM||||Hey Craig its good to see you here on this forum and still into Fieros.  I met you in Carlisle last year(2000).  Me and Mike Lecompte.  We talked with you and Jesse for a bit.  Talked about your wing stantions.  Still going to be coming out with them?  I always thought they looked really sweet.  Even though I don't have the money or no longer the desire to put more money in my fiero I think others here would want to see them and maybe they would want them.  Just wanted to say hi and welcome to the forum.<P>Did you know your GPE intake website is still up?  I forget the addy but I have run into it recently.  Kind of cool looking but I know West Coast makes a cool looking one.<P>------------------<BR>Shaun 85 GT with nitrous<BR>0-60 in 5.6 seconds<BR><A HREF="http://members.aol.com/Shaun41178" TARGET=_blank>Preferred Performance</A>||||reg||1
Z||000003||The Fieromaster||06-05-2001||06:45 PM||||Shaun... HI!  yea after I nuked my tranny I bought an Eclipse and that didnt last too long (eclipse + telephone pole @ 85mph = DOA Eclipse)  As for wing stantions... unfortunatly Jesse was our man for fiberglas and when he died so did the knowledge he had.  I am going to se what i can do though... Although we are sellng other parts like the FULL (front and back) brake conversions for like ONLY 250$ us!  And were working on the intakes and a whole NEW manifold setup... also a few other toys!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> Soon my friend soon!  As for GPE a few people have mailed me but GPE is now NRFD Motorsports (No Room For Doubt - co. Jess and I started) well GLAD to hear from you!  Hope to see you at any upcoming show.  (i was at Carlisle this year werent you)<P><P>------------------<BR>~In Memory Of Jesse Cesek~ 1980-2000<BR>The Fieromaster<BR>Craig Gibson<BR>fieromaster@ncweb.com<BR>1985 GT ~Purple, Black and Yellow Interior(Fastback Converted)<BR>1985 GT ~Red/grey lowers, grey interior (sold)<BR>1985 SE ~Black, tan inside (sold-needed serious TLC)<BR>1997 Mitsu Eclipse GSX (AWD, Turbo) DOA on 12/10/2000||||reg||10
